        "workup_and_crystallization": "Green precipitate filtered, washed with cold MeCN (20 mL) and Et2O (10 mL), and dried overnight at 60 °C. No single-crystal structure of 1Y is reported.",
        "yield": "69–95% based on Ln for the 1Ln series"
